sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as React UI
  participant XLS as SheetJS
  participant API as Express API
  participant DB as MongoDB
  participant Mail as Nodemailer/Gmail
  User->>UI: Enter message and select workbook
  UI->>XLS: Parse workbook
  XLS-->>UI: Sheet1 column A values
  User->>UI: Click Send
  UI->>API: POST /sendmail {msg, bulkEmail}
  Note over API: Route has no authentication
  API->>DB: Read user collection
  DB-->>API: Sender email and password
  loop Each submitted value
    API->>Mail: Send one message
    Mail-->>API: Provider response or error
  end
  API-->>UI: Boolean response
  Note over UI,API: No per-recipient delivery report
